~proc: limits: Limit                     Soft Limit           Hard Limit           Units     
~proc: limits: Max cpu time              unlimited            unlimited            seconds   
~proc: limits: Max file size             unlimited            unlimited            bytes     
~proc: limits: Max data size             unlimited            unlimited            bytes     
~proc: limits: Max stack size            1048576              1048576              bytes     
~proc: limits: Max core file size        0                    unlimited            bytes     
~proc: limits: Max resident set          unlimited            unlimited            bytes     
~proc: limits: Max processes             unlimited            unlimited            processes 
~proc: limits: Max open files            1024                 1024                 files     
~proc: limits: Max locked memory         unlimited            unlimited            bytes     
~proc: limits: Max address space         unlimited            unlimited            bytes     
~proc: limits: Max file locks            unlimited            unlimited            locks     
~proc: limits: Max pending signals       unlimited            unlimited            signals   
~proc: limits: Max msgqueue size         unlimited            unlimited            bytes     
~proc: limits: Max nice priority         unlimited            unlimited            
~proc: limits: Max realtime priority     unlimited            unlimited            
~proc: limits: Max realtime timeout      unlimited            unlimited            us        
~proc: /proc/<its pid>/limits is /proc/self/limits: yes
~proc: core_pattern: "core"
